These seven phases together establish the complete architectural foundation of COREI OS.

Phase-07 therefore begins the **Institutional Design System**—not merely a visual style guide, but the architectural language through which the Workbench communicates institutional reality. It defines typography, colour, spacing, motion, iconography, visual hierarchy, semantic tokens, interaction states, and presentation principles so that every capability, workspace, and terminal expresses one coherent institutional identity while remaining fully aligned with the COREI Constitution, the Workbench Architecture, the COREI Anchor Law, and the Master Trader Persona.

